## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
## Defines the core Enumerable pipeline container for fluent collection querying.
##
## `Enumerable` itself stays ungated (core container shared by every slice);
## the chained methods in `pipeline.alya` and the factories in `lib.alya`
## are gated per feature.

